{"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Introduction","y":0.04651162777738338,"w":0.12371133168538417,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.83917526049751434},{"x":0.065979380761730599,"y":0.095930232712906016,"w":0.34639175415039064,"t":"HOW IS IELTS SCORED?","h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1},{"w":0.89484537760416649,"c":1,"y":0.13505578403880514,"t":"IELTS results are reported on a nine-band scale. In addition to the score for overall language","h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.061855661601323109},{"c":1,"t":"ability, IELTS provides a score in the form of a profile for each of the four skills (Listening,","y":0.15257520650479006,"w":0.85577575683593743,"h":0.018955094073704992,"x":0.063870035336625122},{"t":"Reading, Writing and Speaking). These scores are also reported on a nine-band scale. All","h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.17293012337499691,"w":0.86185567220052084,"c":1,"x":0.065979380291492098},{"t":"scores are recorded on the Test Report Form along with details of the candidate's nationality,","x":0.063917517356936168,"h":0.017461491135100426,"y":0.19040697646695648,"w":0.8948453776041666,"c":1},{"y":0.20784883732139359,"t":"first language and date of birth. Each Overall Band Score corresponds to a descriptive","x":0.063917537913049022,"h":0.017441859892096456,"c":1,"w":0.82680409749348971},{"x":0.063917537745556488,"y":0.22812683500793818,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"statement which gives a summary of the English language ability of a candidate classified at","w":0.8886597696940105,"c":1},{"h":0.017079783969953133,"c":1,"w":0.70941792805989579,"t":"that level. The nine bands and their descriptive statements are as follows:","x":0.061792195976817892,"y":0.24534780081110596},{"h":0.017441861012089666,"c":1,"y":0.29505813925938296,"t":"9 Expert User - Has fully operational command of the language: appropriate, accurate and","x":0.061855654794122854,"w":0.89690724690755208},{"t":"fuent with complete understanding.","x":0.090556374364340775,"y":0.31151035704641128,"w":0.34471844991048178,"h":0.018607003508213316,"c":1},{"x":0.063917541395940983,"h":0.017615971814445186,"t":"8 Very Good User - Has fully operational command of the language with only occasional","c":1,"y":0.34586024669957505,"w":0.87216491699218746},{"c":1,"y":0.36482558156032896,"h":0.015988371754420694,"t":"unsystematic inaccuracies and inappropracies. Misunderstandings may occur in","x":0.090721654837595908,"w":0.77525772094726564},{"t":"unfamiliar situations. Handles complex detailed argumentation well.","x":0.090721656987702487,"y":0.38372093039920363,"w":0.65154637654622394,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1},{"w":0.81041971842447913,"x":0.061795469509445221,"c":1,"t":"7 Good User - Has operational command of the language, though with occasional","y":0.41422044431904337,"h":0.020047778601654853},{"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings in some situations. Generally","c":1,"x":0.09072164939337389,"y":0.43452730457139999,"h":0.017615971814445186,"w":0.79999999999999993},{"w":0.66185567220052088,"h":0.015988371754420472,"t":"handles complex language well and understands detailed reasoning.","x":0.090721648328673105,"c":1,"y":0.45348837225970362},{"c":1,"x":0.061855674447561168,"h":0.017615971814445186,"w":0.83711339314778654,"y":0.48532002366792981,"t":"6 Competent User - Has generally effective command of the language despite some"},{"c":1,"x":0.090721645722862454,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropracies and misunderstandings. Can use and understand fairly","y":0.50436046484027186,"h":0.017441861012089777,"w":0.81649485270182287},{"w":0.49690719604492189,"x":0.09072165960954498,"y":0.52319436300180111,"t":"complex language, particularty in familiar situations.","c":1,"h":0.017615971814445075},{"y":0.55374285106325993,"x":0.063871204004647006,"w":0.84958048502604178,"h":0.019899317886433177,"c":1,"t":"5 Modest User - Has partial command of the language, coping with overall meaning in"},{"c":1,"t":"most situations, though is likely to make many mistakes. Should be able to handle basic","x":0.088616740061335311,"y":0.57264011477993892,"h":0.01848326888563212,"w":0.84751241048177084},{"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1,"t":"communication in own field.","x":0.090721653383778147,"y":0.59302325597245187,"w":0.26804122924804691},{"h":0.018533750344778777,"t":"4 Limited User - Basic competence is limited to familiar situations. Has frequent problems","y":0.62351732339322585,"w":0.88668914794921871,"c":1,"x":0.059748973509036983},{"x":0.086597931479354878,"t":"in understanding and expression. Is not able to use complex language.","y":0.64386376967168513,"h":0.01614797416324143,"c":1,"w":0.68659795125325518},{"x":0.061855681265978152,"y":0.67586611858603218,"w":0.83505152384440107,"c":1,"h":0.015994346358813916,"t":"3 Extremely Limited User - Conveys and understands only general meaning in very"},{"w":0.635051523844401,"x":0.086597954108727226,"h":0.017615971814445075,"t":"familiar situations. Frequent breakdowns in communication occur.","y":0.69318849078457689,"c":1},{"t":"2 Intermittent User - No real communication is possible except for the most basic","y":0.72665883712238966,"h":0.01614797416324143,"w":0.80618555704752604,"c":1,"x":0.061855674980320526},{"y":0.74346166102470446,"w":0.80631398518880215,"h":0.018547207624577622,"x":0.086542948657298849,"t":"information using isolated words or short formulae in familiar situations and to meet","c":1},{"y":0.76300410796444962,"c":1,"x":0.088613532857964972,"t":"immediate needs. Has great difficulty understanding spoken and written English.","h":0.018968518313700833,"w":0.77533838907877595},{"w":0.88453613281249999,"c":1,"t":"1 Non User - Essentially has no ability to use the language beyond possibly a few isolated","h":0.017441861012089777,"y":0.79651162763145245,"x":0.06185564483062251},{"t":"words.","x":0.087566769213974466,"y":0.81275649757270807,"w":0.070603268941243497,"h":0.019297196034886666,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.65154637654622383,"t":"0 Did not attempt the test - No assessable information provided.","x":0.059793821932079112,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.84732824446758626},{"c":1,"w":0.29146792093912754,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.3521918184962084,"y":0.9543054561580997,"h":0.022615832576874939},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"x":0.93814432993969799,"c":1,"y":0.95348837191889579,"t":"7","w":0.020618556340535443}],"w":2400,"h":3406}